      sub: "work",
      desc: "Work type for any project that is not better described by a more specific type: an office\nmove, a policy rollout, a vendor selection, a process improvement, a report. A legitimate\nchoice, not a failure path \u2014 it gives the project a stage-gate ladder, a dated milestone\nskeleton, starter risks and a weekly team update, so it runs from day one.",
