      column: "packs",
      label: "work-ops-cycle",
      sub: "work",
      desc: "Work type for recurring operational work that never finishes but whose periods do: a month-end\nor quarter-end close, a budget cycle, a compliance calendar, a recurring reporting process.\nGives the project the cycle ladder (prepare \u2192 execute \u2192 review \u2192 close, then round again) with\none increment per period under the continuous lifecycle, set-up milestones, operational risks,\nKPI suggestions (days to close, on-time rate, adjustments, open reconciling items), a period\nchecklist ahead of each close and a period close report to the sponsor.",
