      label: "sred-canada",
      sub: "bundled",
      desc: "Default behavior pack for the `sred` capability plugin: Canadian projects claiming\nthe SR&ED tax incentive (CRA T661/T2SCH1). Configures the annual CRA claim chain\n(cost categorization \u2192 T661 narrative \u2192 audit-risk review \u2192 advisor handoff, all\nfiscal-year-anchored with the 18-month hard deadline), CRA-preferred language\nguidance, SR&ED readiness gate injections, publication coordination, and the\narchive tail (claims legitimately outlive project closeout).\n\nBehavior only. Entities, skills, templates, and the validator ship with the `sred`\ncapability plugin (capabilities/sred/) \u2014 this pack contains no substrate extensions\nand no skills, per CAPABILITY-PLUGINS.md \xA76.\n\nCoexists with any active project pack (pic-pcais, client-services, agile-default,\nboard-investor): resolution is per-matrix-entry via the `profile:` field.",
